through Tsuki with `slssteam-ronin` enabled. Both module payload sets mapped
from Tsuki's deployed package directories, CloudRedirect published fresh
runtime evidence for Steam PID 1202358, and authenticated Google Drive
initialized normally. An unchanged config notification rebound Google Drive
inside that same Steam process (`active=1`). Re-submitting the existing
